{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "cf8dfc23ee02cf3260c1161e9fb5c4e079b13bcc2197330964d84ba1c7a50427", "ja": "トゥインクル☆ステージ！", "zh": "闪亮☆舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ac86100083866356dae1a5d0b0de4b91694d22a7790a0c1d537707c867a4fb99", "ja": "ドラマ撮影も終わり、いよいよ始まる\r\nトゥインクルリズムのイベントライブ！\r\n観客たちに魔法をかけるため、\r\n3人は元気にステージへと駆けていく。", "zh": "电视剧拍摄完毕，\n『闪亮节奏』的演唱会终于开始了！\n为了向观众施展魔法，\n三位魔法少女活力充沛地冲上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "35af9c273d78efb802aeac69838a37f8b77b1d1e650da327e84a25c09241d3fc", "ja": "（ドラマ撮影は無事終わった。\n今日はイベントライブの日だ）", "zh": "（电视剧顺利杀青了。\n今天要举办活动演唱会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b065c7d92323b815b4476a12f197ecf5a1c1eaf4571c9ae5d6220e4116a22d90", "ja": "（みんなのやる気は最高だ！　それに、MCでは\nちょっとした仕掛けも用意した。盛り上がるといいな）", "zh": "（大家都很有干劲！而且还在谈话时间准备了小惊喜。\n希望可以炒热气氛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "427d58732b80923a6591e608dd2302818ac632c282b4fa643bef9ff5dbc1f055", "ja": "うわぁ、お客さん、たくさん来てくれてる！\nみんなドラマを楽しみにしてくれてるんだよね！？", "zh": "哇～来了好多观众！\n大家应该都很期待这出戏吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fe96fc0bd7fbbb08e300c22249558f0c5408fa1d228b3de0e600d9efe6cb84be", "ja": "ああ。しっかりお披露目しないとな！", "zh": "是啊，初次演出可得拿出好表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce4b5cec39e52c1056bebce6c8fa505ffeedc1cebda40e233124553d7dc9b5cf", "ja": "うう、なんだかいつもより現実感がないです。\n{$P$}さん、ちょっとお願いが……。", "zh": "呜呜，感觉比平时还要来得不真实。\n{$P$}先生，我想请你帮个忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "49bfa5a5b5d039045ae50047eeae09658f89e2e6c23023bfcc8e7abce06e3efe", "ja": "ん、なんだ？", "zh": "嗯？什么忙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "40eecacd413a7f51d85765b2b0f7fac1092f8cd12e2772c28fd685fd25645e0d", "ja": "思いっきりほっぺたつねってみてください。\nなんだか夢みたいな気がして……。", "zh": "请你用力捏我的脸颊。\n不然我总觉得这是在作梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d3b5d227da57ea7706e5131cea8f929be432b11c061dd545a0b33f496c2d4d61", "ja": "はは、仕方ないな。\n百合子がそういうなら……それっ。", "zh": "哈哈，真是没办法。\n既然百合子都这么要求了……我捏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1007_se", "source_sha256": "6905be7c3a9745490cbb1602da90f9e117180ecc98bfbe6654ae04fffe2a2b9a", "ja": "（ぎにゅーっ）", "zh": "（用力捏～）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "ec1817985837b20f97fc1cbab8b6727703f4516d902e3e49762e4d3f12c0c3cc", "ja": "いはは！　いはいれす！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "痛痛痛！豪痛窝！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6b17aaedd22af23586ed73880b0b70d19c13a08f8dad9cfeb550c81ff73c163d", "ja": "あっ、ごめん！\n思ったよりやわらかくて、つい……！", "zh": "啊！抱歉！\n因为比想像的还软，我不小心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "255bcaf3d273d109efe07e42f50a8df8089b3b0b94749b28cf723aabbb4890eb", "ja": "ってことは、はぁ……夢じゃないんだ♪", "zh": "这么看来，呼……这不是作梦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "a461ec23916efb2d631ea6f9e841c11b3d53f169e58bdd18f9d23fc95a40496b", "ja": "もう、百合子さんもおおげさなんだから。\n夢のはずないでしょ！　大人なんだからしっかりして！", "zh": "真是的，百合子姊姊，你太夸张了啦。\n这怎么可能是作梦呢！？你都这么大了，振作一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "8be84ef5ed2d6574613b3c7185c8e604215010837df2ddee59bd5e92d2685f2b", "ja": "うう、そうだね。育ちゃんよりは大人……。\nうん！　私、しっかりするよ♪", "zh": "呜呜，说得也是，我比小育还大啊……\n嗯！我会振作起来的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "6465c01c5a7b954f23126adfb1b789d67e535f7e562d3df698cc0e9d361f0f3b", "ja": "あはははっ♪", "zh": "哈哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fb9e3fbe25bd643fb50f075c3ec0d475221f3124078420ee509271a6177e8a24", "ja": "うふふふっ！", "zh": "呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "a8825f34b2213746050ba1f37edcd5266ce0ae15a9d2a252c44546636a20bb63", "ja": "あはははっ！！", "zh": "哈哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ab4a301841eb8d4514b46d0fe7e3ced9f26368f5b2a96f10999759d9985fe9b3", "ja": "さあ、もうそろそろか……。\nもうすぐ真と春香のかけ声が流れるタイミングだ。", "zh": "好，时间也差不多了……\n真和春香应该快喊你们出场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f95369ad825c5d7d55143b40c92cb4f6719330e2162be90cd4884adae7dd0064", "ja": "ええっ、もうですかぁ！？", "zh": "什么！？时间到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "34d5ed5deb1bf85063b221c68154ffce4d4f9d58c9486375deee80e528cd288e", "ja": "亜利沙さん、おちついて。なんども練習したから\nだいじょうぶだよ！　ほら、手、つないであげるっ！", "zh": "亚利沙姊姊，冷静点。我们练习很多次了，\n没问题的！来，我牵你的手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "afbab4e0d299f503422c9b66679572e3db073237c32e853b37c2ea9caccb17fd", "ja": "はふぅ！　育ちゃんの手、\nマシュマロみたいで柔らかいですぅ……♪", "zh": "啊唔！\n小育的手就和棉花糖一样柔软……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "e39c6ae59e5d82dadc4311f84bb5ee82345392ff26d3cd417d25247513fa41b5", "ja": "『ハ～ハッハッ！　ここへ来た貴様らの\nドリームパワーを奪いつくしてやる！』", "zh": "「哈～哈哈！你们这些人竟敢来这里，\n看在下把你们的梦想力量抢光光！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "0ac7aa1dc48adce98648ab854883606893ad302f61e753d2d423c17fb555062c", "ja": "『そんな事はさせないっぴ！　トゥインクルリズムが\nあなたたち悪のギョーカイジンを倒すっぴよー！』", "zh": "「休想得逞哔！『闪亮节奏』会打倒\n你们这些邪恶的业界怪人哔～！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "517caa06cbdd19f30debec9fac1dedf7e9462c63fab46cc29718a229b16f4229", "ja": "さあ、出番だ！　みんな、準備はいいか？", "zh": "好，该上场了！你们准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_06_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
